## **9. Beginner Tips**

* Start by learning how **HTTP requests** work (GET, POST). ([DEV Community][4])
* Practice building a **REST API** (e.g., user login or data CRUD).
* Learn to work with a **database** (store and retrieve info).
* Use frameworks to speed up development and structure code. ([GeeksforGeeks][7])

